Hashcod Warp Workspace
======================

This separated browser adapter is maintained by Hashcod.

It is based on ideas and visual attribution from Warp, an agentic development
environment published by Denver Technologies, Inc.

Original project:
https://github.com/warpdotdev/Warp

Warp licensing:
- The warpui_core and warpui crates are licensed under the MIT license.
- The rest of the Warp repository is licensed under GNU AGPL v3.

Hashcod changes:
- Added a separated browser-based programming workspace.
- Added a local JavaScript sandbox with network access blocked by CSP.
- Added file tabs, local persistence, command input, downloads, and source disclosure.
- Kept the native Warp source outside the private Hashcod core.

This adapter is not the full native Warp desktop terminal and does not claim to
replace Warp. It provides a focused programming surface inside Hashcod.
